time=2024-07-20T13:38:35.545+04:00 level=DEBUG msg="done with this subproject" lines="[{ID:114 Position:2772.5344070721517 Length:4.89795918367347 Chords: Text:} {ID:115 Position:2777.432366255825 Length:19.591836734693878 Chords:1 4 1 4 Text:} {ID:116 Position:2797.024202990519 Length:2.4489795918 Chords:1 Text:^Who breaks the power} {ID:117 Position:2799.4731825823187 Length:2.4489795918 Chords: Text:Of sin and darkness} {ID:118 Position:2801.922162174119 Length:2.4111402554 Chords:4 Text:^Whose love is mighty} {ID:119 Position:2804.333302429519 Length:2.4478881886 Chords: Text:And so much stronger} {ID:120 Position:2806.781190618119 Length:2.3887604545 Chords:6m 5 Text:^The King of Glory} {ID:121 Position:2809.169951072619 Length:3.9418489349 Chords:4 Text:The King above all kings^} {ID:122 Position:2816.659464048819 Length:2.3335745694 Chords:1 Text:^Who shakes the whole Earth} {ID:123 Position:2818.993038618219 Length:2.5661436566 Chords: Text:With holy thunder} {ID:124 Position:2821.559182274819 Length:2.3848186056 Chords:4 Text:^Who leaves us breathless} {ID:125 Position:2823.944000880419 Length:2.4321207928 Chords: Text:In awe and wonder} {ID:126 Position:2826.376121673219 Length:2.4281789439 Chords:6m 5 Text:^The King of Glory} {ID:127 Position:2828.8043006171188 Length:4.2899477248 Chords:4 Text:The King above all kings^} {ID:128 Position:2833.743437332507 Length:4.8681834345 Chords:1 Text:This is amazing gr^ace} {ID:129 Position:2838.611620767007 Length:4.8760671324 Chords:4 Text:This is unfailing l^ove} {ID:130 Position:2843.487687899407 Length:4.9194274707 Chords:6m Text:That You would take my p^lace} {ID:131 Position:2848.407115370107 Length:4.8524160388 Chords:5 Text:That You would bear my cr^oss} {ID:132 Position:2853.2595314089067 Length:4.899718226 Chords:1 Text:You laid down Your l^ife} {ID:133 Position:2858.1592496349067 Length:6.5434692319 Chords:4 Text:That I would be set fr^ee} {ID:134 Position:2864.7027188668067 Length:3.2401998244 Chords:6m 5 Text:Oh^ Jesus I sing for} {ID:135 Position:2867.942918691207 Length:2.5506720544 Chords: Text:All that You've done for me} {ID:136 Position:2870.493590745621 Length:9.795918367346928 Chords:1 4 Text:} {ID:137 Position:2880.485748898068 Length:2.5194630277 Chords:1 Text:В порядок хаос} {ID:138 Position:2883.005211925768 Length:2.2881520625 Chords: Text:Кто превращает?} {ID:139 Position:2885.293363988268 Length:2.336984127 Chords:4 Text:Детьми своими} {ID:140 Position:2887.630348115268 Length:2.7307449682 Chords: Text:Кто называет?} {ID:141 Position:2890.361093083468 Length:2.373860907 Chords:6m Text:Это - Царь славы,} {ID:142 Position:2892.734953990468 Length:2.4319814494 Chords:5 Text:Это - Царь славы} {ID:143 Position:2895.166935439868 Length:2.3611470383 Chords:1 Text:Кто справедливо} {ID:144 Position:2897.528082478168 Length:2.4229001147 Chords: Text:В народах правит?} {ID:145 Position:2899.950982592868 Length:2.6317708142 Chords:4 Text:В великолепьи} {ID:146 Position:2902.582753407068 Length:2.2903126271 Chords: Text:Светом сияет?} {ID:147 Position:2904.873066034168 Length:2.5573038692 Chords:6m 5 Text:^Это - Царь славы,} {ID:148 Position:2907.430369903368 Length:3.5946548893 Chords:4 Text:Это - Царь всех цар^ей} {ID:149 Position:2912.1107842712822 Length:4.8681834345 Chords:1 Text:Чудесна благодать} {ID:150 Position:2916.9789677057825 Length:4.8760671324 Chords:4 Text:Верна Твоя любовь} {ID:151 Position:2921.8550348381823 Length:4.9194274707 Chords:6m Text:Ведь Ты тяжёлый крест} {ID:152 Position:2926.7744623088824 Length:4.8524160388 Chords:5 Text:Вместо меня понёс} {ID:153 Position:2931.626878347682 Length:4.899718226 Chords:1 Text:Свою Ты жизнь отдал,} {ID:154 Position:2936.526596573682 Length:6.5434692319 Chords:4 Text:Чтоб был свободен я.} {ID:155 Position:2943.070065805582 Length:3.2401998244 Chords:6m 5 Text:^О том, что сделал Ты,} {ID:156 Position:2946.3102656299825 Length:2.5506720544 Chords: Text:Я буду петь всегда.} {ID:157 Position:2953.50595226937 Length:4.9314739675 Chords:1 Text:Достоин Агнец, что заклан был.} {ID:158 Position:2958.43742623687 Length:4.8805133128 Chords:4 Text:Достоин Ты наш Царь, что смерть победил.} {ID:159 Position:2963.3179395496704 Length:4.887844401 Chords:1 Text:Достоин Агнец, что заклан был.} {ID:160 Position:2968.20578395067 Length:4.8368837462 Chords:4 Text:Достоин Ты наш Царь, что смерть победил.} {ID:161 Position:2973.1353880557635 Length:4.8165944031 Chords:1 Text:Worthy is the Lamb, who was slain} {ID:162 Position:2977.9519824588638 Length:4.8266786319 Chords:4 Text:Worthy is the King, who conquered the grave} {ID:163 Position:2982.7786610907638 Length:3.6063407878 Chords:6m 1 Text:^Worthy is the Lamb, who was sl^ain} {ID:164 Position:2986.385001878564 Length:4.1926476447 Chords:4 Text:Worthy w^orthy worthy} {ID:165 Position:2990.4781312100577 Length:4.8681834345 Chords:1 Text:This is amazing gr^ace} {ID:166 Position:2995.346314644558 Length:4.8760671324 Chords:4 Text:This is unfailing l^ove} {ID:167 Position:3000.2223817769577 Length:4.9194274707 Chords:6m Text:That You would take my p^lace} {ID:168 Position:3005.141809247658 Length:4.8524160388 Chords:5 Text:That You would bear my cr^oss} {ID:169 Position:3009.9942252864575 Length:4.899718226 Chords:1 Text:You laid down Your l^ife} {ID:170 Position:3014.8939435124576 Length:6.5434692319 Chords:4 Text:That I would be set fr^ee} {ID:171 Position:3021.4374127443575 Length:3.2401998244 Chords:6m 5 Text:Oh^ Jesus I sing for} {ID:172 Position:3024.677612568758 Length:2.5506720544 Chords: Text:All that You've done for me} {ID:173 Position:3027.228284623172 Length:19.591836734693857 Chords:1 4 1 4 Text:} {ID:174 Position:3046.820121357866 Length:4.897959183673493 Chords:1 Text:}]"
