1441987471 Chords: Text:And again and again} {ID:196 Position:4114.393388352775 Length:9.244847112 Chords:1 2m7 6m7 4 Text:^>Ohhh^> ohhh^> ohhh^} {ID:197 Position:4124.330904125786 Length:4.9668244001 Chords:1 2m7 Text:^>Отец, от на^чала} {ID:198 Position:4129.297728525886 Length:5.2554744526 Chords:6m7 4 Text:^>Как помочь мне Ты зн^ал} {ID:199 Position:4134.553202978485 Length:5.8996132099 Chords:1 2m7 Text:^>Твой Сын искупл^енье} {ID:200 Position:4140.452816188385 Length:4.2073170866 Chords:6m7 4 Text:^>Сердцам даров^ал} {ID:201 Position:4144.917013092104 Length:5.9774839897 Chords:1 2m7 Text:^>Осмыслить не в с^илах} {ID:202 Position:4150.894497081804 Length:2.6752753841 Chords:6m7 4 Text:^>Безмерной любв^и} {ID:203 Position:4153.569772465904 Length:2.6482524005 Chords:1 Text:Никак не пон^ять,} {ID:204 Position:4156.218024866404 Length:2.6752753842 Chords:2m7 Text:Умом не об^ъять} {ID:205 Position:4158.893300250605 Length:6.7887308346 Chords:6m7 5 4 Text:Лишь знаю, мне ^ну - ж^ен ^Ты!} {ID:206 Position:4164.092522310323 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:1 Text:К Отцу вновь бег^у я} {ID:207 Position:4166.720259536623 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:2m7 Text:В Его благо^дать} {ID:208 Position:4169.347996762924 Length:2.6277372262 Chords:6m7 Text:Нет силы скры^ваться} {ID:209 Position:4171.975733989124 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:4 Text:Причины нет жд^ать!} {ID:210 Position:4174.603471215423 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:1 Text:Нужен сердцу цел^итель} {ID:211 Position:4177.2312084417235 Length:2.1897810219 Chords:2m7 Text:Душе нужен д^руг} {ID:212 Position:4179.420989463623 Length:3.0656934306 Chords:6m7 Text:Так что снова и с^нова} {ID:213 Position:4182.486682894223 Length:2.0730472542 Chords:4 Text:К Отцу я бег^у,} {ID:214 Position:4184.559730148424 Length:2.1441987471 Chords: Text:Вновь к Отцу я бегу} {ID:215 Position:4187.970030688542 Length:9.244847112 Chords:1 2m7 6m7 4 Text:^>Ohhh^> ohhh^> ohhh^} {ID:216 Position:4198.480979593652 Length:9.244847112 Chords:1 2m7 6m7 4 Text:^>Ohhh^> ohhh^> ohhh^} {ID:217 Position:4205.731073185962 Length:5.5991622182 Chords:6m7 4 Text:My heart has been ^in Your s^ights} {ID:218 Position:4211.330235404162 Length:5.2586726238 Chords:1/3 5 Text:Long before ^my first br^eath} {ID:219 Position:4216.588908027961 Length:4.907373836 Chords:6m7 4 Text:Running in^to Your ^arms} {ID:220 Position:4221.4962818639615 Length:7.251442652 Chords:1/3 5 Text:Is running to ^life from d^eath} {ID:221 Position:4227.079230291881 Length:5.0262749642 Chords:6m7 4 Text:And I feel this ^rush deep in my ch^est} {ID:222 Position:4232.1055052560805 Length:5.6478035888 Chords:1/3 5 Text:Your mercy is ^calling ^out} {ID:223 Position:4237.753308844881 Length:5.2424588336 Chords:6m7 4 Text:Just as I ^am You pull me ^in} {ID:224 Position:4242.995767678481 Length:6.7738546476 Chords:1/3 5 Text:And I know I ^need You n^ow} {ID:225 Position:4248.180113551199 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:1 Text:I run to the F^ather} {ID:226 Position:4250.807850777499 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:2m7 Text:I fall into g^race} {ID:227 Position:4253.435588003799 Length:2.6277372262 Chords:6m7 Text:I'm done with the ^hiding} {ID:228 Position:4256.0633252299995 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:4 Text:No reason to w^ait} {ID:229 Position:4258.691062456299 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:1 Text:My heart needs a s^urgeon} {ID:230 Position:4261.318799682599 Length:2.1897810219 Chords:2m7 Text:My soul needs a fr^iend} {ID:231 Position:4263.508580704499 Length:3.0656934306 Chords:6m7 Text:So I'll run to the ^Father} {ID:232 Position:4266.574274135099 Length:2.0730472542 Chords:4 Text:Again and ag^ain} {ID:233 Position:4268.6473213893 Length:2.1441987471 Chords: Text:And again and again} {ID:234 Position:4269.202011361418 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:1 Text:I run to the F^ather} {ID:235 Position:4271.829748587718 Length:2.6277372263 Chords:2m7 Text:I fall into g^race} {ID:236 Position:4274.457485814019 Length:2.6277372262 Chords:6m7 Text:I'm done with the ^hiding} {ID:237 Position:4277.08